# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local probe scratch
#
# Debugging this stack means dumping openapi.json, filter vocabularies and query
# shapes to disk to diff them. Four such files (_openapi.json, _filters.json,
# _openapi_probe.json, .phase11-scratch/) had to be deleted by hand before the
# first commit; these patterns stop the next session leaving the same litter.
#
# Verified against the tracked tree: no real file matches either pattern, so
# nothing legitimate is shadowed. Keep the leading underscore convention for
# throwaway dumps and they stay out of git automatically.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_*.json
_*.txt
*-scratch/
.*-scratch/
